{"abstract":"Current language models require a lot of training data to obtain high performance. For Relation Classification (RC), many datasets are domain-specific, so combining datasets to obtain better performance is non-trivial. We explore a multi-domain training setup for RC, and attempt to improve performance by encoding domain information. Our proposed models improve > 2 Macro-F1 against the baseline setup, and our analysis reveals that not all the labels benefit the same: The classes which occupy a similar space across domains (i.e., their interpretation is close across them, for example “physical”) benefit the least, while domain-dependent relations (e.g., “part-of”) improve the most when encoding domain information.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Bassignana, Elisa","Unmack Gascou, Viggo","Nøhr Laustsen, Frida","Kristensen, Gustav","Haahr Petersen, Marie","van der Goot, Rob","Plank, Barbara"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-747225"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["DOMAIN","Multi domain training","Relation Classification","Robustness"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"how to encode domain information in relation classification","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2024.lrec-main.728.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-747225","identifier":[{"id":"85195940749","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-4a4cff0a-a185-4211-9e3d-907605af2508"],"keyword":["Domain","Multi-domain training","Relation Classification","Robustness"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-97A3E9F53EED0AA028ED91388E49D33E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2024.lrec-main.728.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Elisa","key":"bassignanapau","last":"Bassignana","locid":"c6b67626-5ff8-4730-93a6-70ee08f6013e","name":"Bassignana, Elisa","orcid":"0009-0003-8374-7571","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Viggo","key":"unmackgascoupau","last":"Unmack Gascou","name":"Unmack Gascou, Viggo","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Frida","key":"nøhrlaustsenpau","last":"Nøhr Laustsen","name":"Nøhr Laustsen, Frida","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Gustav","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","name":"Kristensen, Gustav","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Marie","key":"haahrpetersenpau","last":"Haahr Petersen","name":"Haahr Petersen, Marie","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rob","key":"vandergootpau","last":"van der Goot","locid":"8e5f2a6c-c817-4a90-b48b-d9171743ad0f","name":"van der Goot, Rob","orcid":"0009-0003-1999-4156","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Barbara","key":"plankpau","last":"Plank","locid":"f073ebac-704d-4236-9206-d1d2ef2be9c3","name":"Plank, Barbara","orcid":"0000-0002-4394-1965","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"8301-8306","publisher":"European Language Resources Association","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 2024 Joint International Conference on Computational Linguistics, Language Resources and Evaluation (LREC-COLING 2024)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":